# Atlas — security hardening (Sprint 13)
# Run against: dotnet run --project src/Atlas.Api
# Demonstrates: AF-6 login lockout (429 + Retry-After), AF-3 cross-org worker read (404).

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Set up an org + admin
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-org
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgName": "Brute Test GmbH",
  "email": "victim@brute.example",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery",
  "displayName": "Vic Tim"
}

# ── AF-6: login rate limiting + lockout ───────────────────────────────────────
# Fire this wrong-password request SIX times. Attempts 1–5 return 401 (uniform
# "Invalid email or password"). The 6th returns 429 Too Many Requests with a
# Retry-After header — the password is no longer even checked.

### Wrong password (repeat 6x to trip the lockout)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "victim@brute.example",
  "password": "definitely-wrong"
}

### Now the CORRECT password — still 429 while locked (lockout is on the identifier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "victim@brute.example",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery"
}

### A different account is unaffected — the throttle is keyed per identifier
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register-org
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orgName": "Bystander Ltd",
  "email": "calm@bystander.example",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery",
  "displayName": "By Stander"
}

### ...logs in normally
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "calm@bystander.example",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery"
}

# ── AF-3: cross-org worker read is 404 (need-to-know), not a leak ──────────────
# As Org A's admin, hire a worker and note its id from the Location header.

### Org A hires a worker (use Org A's token)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/workers
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ORG_A_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 3f9c2a10-0000-0000-0000-00000000af03

{
  "fullName": "Maria Santos",
  "contactEmail": "maria@orga.example",
  "country": "DEU",
  "hiredOn": "2026-08-01",
  "jobTitle": "Engineer",
  "annualSalary": 60000,
  "weeklyHours": 40
}

### Org A admin reads the worker detail → 200 (HR-manager-and-up only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workers/PASTE_WORKER_ID
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ORG_A_TOKEN

### Org B admin reads the SAME worker id → 404 (AF-3 fix: org-scoped, need-to-know)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/workers/PASTE_WORKER_ID
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ORG_B_TOKEN
